  "prompt": "How did each parent category's net revenue in 2025 compare with 2024? Use the sales table. Return three columns, in this order: parent_category, revenue_2024_eur, the sum of net_revenue_eur over the order lines with an order_date from 2024-01-01 to 2024-12-31, and revenue_2025_eur, the same for an order_date from 2025-01-01 to 2025-12-31, both ends included each time. Lines with a missing net_revenue_eur add nothing, and a category with no net revenue in a year shows 0 for that year, not a missing value. Return one row per parent_category. Do not round. Any row order is fine.",
